# Large GUI splash-screen assets — fetched from the `ci-assets` GitHub Release
# in CI, kept locally for development. See the "Fetch large GUI assets" step
# in .github/workflows/cli.yml for details on uploading / updating.
#
# No trailing slash: a worktree gets these by symlinking gui/videos at the main
# checkout's copy rather than fetching them again, and git counts a symlink as a
# file, so `gui/videos/` matched the directory in the main checkout and nothing at
# all in a worktree. `git add -A` then committed the symlink — an absolute path
# into one machine — which is how it reached a branch once already.
gui/videos